sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Gerrit as Gerrit Code Review
    participant Zuul as Zuul System (Scheduler)
    participant Nodes as Nodes (Infra)
    participant Job as Job Executor
    actor Reviewer as Infra Core Team
    participant Repo as Project-Config Repo
    participant Prod as Production (System/GitHub)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. CHECK PIPELINE (Verification)
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(235, 245, 251)
        Note right of Dev: 1. CHECK Pipeline (On PR Creation)
        
        Dev->>Gerrit: git push (Modify: projects.yaml, acls/...)
        Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Patchset Created
        
        %% Speculative Loading (Inner Rect Removed)
        Note right of Zuul: Speculative Config Evaluation<br/>(Loads config from change context)

        par Resource & Config Eval
            Zuul->>Nodes: Request Node (ubuntu-focal/centos)
            Nodes-->>Zuul: Assign Fresh Node
        and Job Selection Logic
            Note right of Zuul: Evaluate 'zuul.d/*.yaml'<br/>Apply 'files:' matchers & pipeline config
            Note right of Zuul: (Not based on tox.ini directly)
        end

        %% Job: Linters
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openstack-zuul-jobs-linters
        Note right of Job: Ansible: Setup workspace
        Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e linters (Implementation defined in tox.ini)

        %% Job: Gerrit Config Validation
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] project-config-gerrit
        Note right of Job: Validates YAML structure & ACL integrity
        Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e gerrit
        Note right of Job: Script: tools/check_valid_gerrit_projects.py

        %% Job: IRC Config Validation
        opt Matcher: 'accessbot/**'
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] project-config-irc
            Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e irc
        end

        %% POST-RUN (Cleanup)
        %% (Inner Rect Removed)
        Note right of Zuul: 🧹 Automatic Post-Run
        Job->>Gerrit: Upload Logs (console.log, error.log)
        Zuul->>Nodes: Delete/Return Nodes (Cleanup)
        Note right of Zuul: Resources released regardless of Success/Fail

        alt ❌ Check Failed (Verified -1)
            Job--xZuul: Result: FAILURE
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Report: Verified -1
            Note right of Dev: Action: Fix YAML syntax or Logic
        else ✅ Check Passed (Verified +1)
            Job-->>Zuul: Result: SUCCESS
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Report: Verified +1
            Note right of Dev: Action: Wait for Core Review
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. HUMAN REVIEW (Policy Check)
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(255, 253, 231)
        Note right of Dev: 2. HUMAN REVIEW (Infra Core Team)
        
        Note right of Zuul: Zuul is idle (Waiting for events)

        alt 🚫 Vote -1/-2 (Code-Review)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review -1
            
        else ⏳ Vote +2 (Code-Review Only)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review +2 (Approved)
            Note right of Gerrit: Waiting for Workflow +1
            
        else 🚀 Full Approval (CR+2 & WF+1)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review +2, Workflow +1
            Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Review Updated (Change Approved)
            Note right of Zuul: Action: Trigger GATE Pipeline
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. GATE PIPELINE (Final Safety Check)
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(220, 237, 200)
        Note right of Zuul: 3. GATE Pipeline (Pre-Merge Check)
        
        Note right of Zuul: Context: Master + Dependency Resolved State
        Zuul->>Nodes: Request Clean Nodes

        critical Final Validation (Re-run)
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] project-config-gerrit
            Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e gerrit (Re-validate against current master)
            
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openstack-zuul-jobs-linters
            Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e linters
        end
        
        %% POST-RUN
        Note right of Zuul: 🧹 Automatic Post-Run
        Zuul->>Nodes: Delete/Return Nodes

        alt ❌ Gate Failed (Verified -1)
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Report: Verified -1 / Merge Failed
            Note right of Gerrit: Change remains open (Reset Workflow)
        else ✅ Gate Passed (Verified +2)
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Report: Verified +2
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Submit Change (Merge to Master)
            Note right of Gerrit: Merged
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. POST-MERGE & DEPLOYMENT actions
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(253, 235, 208)
        Note right of Dev: 4. PROMOTE Pipeline (Post-Merge)
        
        Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Ref-Updated (Merged)
        
        Note right of Zuul: ⚙️ Canonical config updated (master)

        par Infrastructure Sync Actions
            %% Action 1: GitHub Mirror
            opt Conditional (Repo/Branch specific)
                Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] maintain-github-mirror
                Job->>Prod: Sync git repos to GitHub (Mirror)
            end

            %% Action 2: Documentation
            opt Publish Infra Docs
                Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] infra-docs
                Job->>Prod: Publish to docs.openstack.org
            end
            
            %% Action 3: System Apply
            Note over Repo, Prod: 🔄 Async Pull Model
            Note right of Prod: Puppet Agents / Ansible (Periodic Pull)
            Prod->>Repo: Fetch latest project-config
            Prod->>Prod: Apply: Create Projects, Update ACLs
        end
    end
